> I don't think that an unready endpoint is being renewed there, I'd like to see an e2e test demonstrating the claim

Sorry for not paying attention the latest version, actually, it has been fixed by [#106497](https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/106497)

Before this pr, proxier will update client-affinity lists for all endpoints:
```go
for _, ep := range allEndpoints {
        // ...

	// Update client-affinity lists.
	if svcInfo.SessionAffinityType() == v1.ServiceAffinityClientIP {
		args = append(args, "-m", "recent", "--name", string(endpointChain), "--set")
	}

        // ...
}
```

After this pr, proxier will update client-affinity lists for `allLocallyReachableEndpoints`, which only include ready endponits:
```go
for _, ep := range allLocallyReachableEndpoints {
    // ...
	
	// Update client-affinity lists.
	if svcInfo.SessionAffinityType() == v1.ServiceAffinityClientIP {
		args = append(args, "-m", "recent", "--name", string(endpointChain), "--set")
	}
	
    // ...
}
```
